.TH AVR\-VM\-SHOW 1 "" "avr 0.1.6" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-vm-show \- Show a VM's details, including connection endpoints and egress rules.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr vm show
[OPTIONS] VM_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show a VM's details, including connection endpoints and egress rules.
.PP
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIVM_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the full VM record (with egress rules) as JSON.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-vm (1),
